@startuml Meta Cost Center - System Context
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Hackathon participant" as user
rectangle "Meta Cost Center\nlocal Go application" as costcenter #E8F5E9
rectangle "Muse Code\nlocal CLI/process" as muse #FFF3E0
database "Muse session logs\nJSONL files" as logs #FFF3E0
database "Cost Center database\nSQLite" as db #E3F2FD
rectangle "Web browser" as browser #F3E5F5
rectangle "Operating system\nLinux or macOS" as os #ECEFF1

user --> costcenter : runs CLI/TUI\nor opens dashboard
muse --> logs : writes session records
costcenter --> logs : reads usage
costcenter --> db : stores normalized usage
browser --> costcenter : localhost HTTP
costcenter --> os : files, terminal,\nprocess APIs

note right of os
  The application stays in user space.
  Linux and macOS differences are
  isolated behind this boundary.
end note
@enduml
